{"id":"bfebe6f2f6fdd590","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-recurrent.md","title":"Recurrent","display":"df-recurrent — Recurrent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-recurrent","aliases":["58-df-recurrent","Recurrent"],"display":"df-recurrent — Recurrent","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-recurrent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-recurrent</span><span>Recurrent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recurrent — Recurrent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x,X\\in V\">\\(x,S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to S\">\\(X:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to S\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recurrent}_S,\\mathrm{Transient}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Recurrent}_S,\\mathrm{Transient}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recurrent}\\vdash\\mathrm{Recurrent}_S(x,X,S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\land x\\in S\\land X:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to S\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in S\\;\\{\\zeta\\in\\Omega:X(\\zeta,n)=a\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:X(\\zeta,0)=x\\})=1\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(X(\\zeta,n)=x)\\})=1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recurrent}\\vdash\\mathrm{Recurrent}_S(x,X,S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\land x\\in S\\land X:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to S\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in S\\;\\{\\zeta\\in\\Omega:X(\\zeta,n)=a\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:X(\\zeta,0)=x\\})=1\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(X(\\zeta,n)=x)\\})=1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recurrent}\\vdash\\mathrm{Transient}_S(x,X,S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\land x\\in S\\land X:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to S\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in S\\;\\{\\zeta\\in\\Omega:X(\\zeta,n)=a\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:X(\\zeta,0)=x\\})=1\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(X(\\zeta,n)=x)\\})&lt;1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recurrent}\\vdash\\mathrm{Transient}_S(x,X,S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\land x\\in S\\land X:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to S\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in S\\;\\{\\zeta\\in\\Omega:X(\\zeta,n)=a\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:X(\\zeta,0)=x\\})=1\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(X(\\zeta,n)=x)\\})&lt;1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Recurrent: almost sure return to starting point</li>\n<li>Under a Markov-chain law started at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>, the first return time is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_x^+=\\inf\\{n\\geq1:X_n=x\\}\">\\(T_x^+=\\inf\\{n\\geq1:X_n=x\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Transience is the complementary condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{P}_x(T_{\\{x\\}}&lt;\\infty)&lt;1\">\\(\\mathbb{P}_x(T_{\\{x\\}}&lt;\\infty)&lt;1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Positive recurrent: finite expected return time</li>\n<li>Null recurrent: infinite expected return time but returns almost surely</li>\n<li>Polya: SRW on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Z}^d\">\\(\\mathbb{Z}^d\\)</span> recurrent for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d \\leq 2\">\\(d \\leq 2\\)</span>, transient for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d \\geq 3\">\\(d \\geq 3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Norris, Markov Chains</li>\n<li>Spitzer, Principles of Random Walk</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Recurrent}_S,\\mathrm{Transient}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recurrent}\\vdash\\mathrm{Recurrent}_S(x,X,S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\land x\\in S\\land X:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to S\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in S\\;\\{\\zeta\\in\\Omega:X(\\zeta,n)=a\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:X(\\zeta,0)=x\\})=1\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(X(\\zeta,n)=x)\\})=1","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recurrent}\\vdash\\mathrm{Transient}_S(x,X,S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P_x)\\land x\\in S\\land X:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to S\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in S\\;\\{\\zeta\\in\\Omega:X(\\zeta,n)=a\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:X(\\zeta,0)=x\\})=1\\land\\mathbb P_x(\\{\\zeta:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(X(\\zeta,n)=x)\\})<1","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"T_x^+=\\inf\\{n\\geq1:X_n=x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{P}_x(T_{\\{x\\}}<\\infty)<1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Z}^d","display":false},{"tex":"d \\leq 2","display":false},{"tex":"d \\geq 3","display":false}],"bytes":1931,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1053","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-recurrent.md|58-df-recurrent]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["0578a357a86e9d8f"]}